{"speciesId":596,"names":{"fr":"Mygavolt","es":"Galvantula","en":"Galvantula","ja":"デンチュラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand on l’attaque, il projette une multitude de fils électrifiés pour créer une barrière électrique."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When attacked, they create an electric barrier by spitting out many electrically charged threads."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il tend des pièges avec ses fils électriques. Il déguste tranquillement ses proies une fois électrocutées."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They employ an electrically charged web to trap their prey. While it is immobilized by shock, they leisurely consume it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It creates barriers from electrified silk that stun foes. This works as a weapon as well as a defense."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It creates barriers from electrified silk that stun foes. This works as a weapon as well as a defense."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il tend des pièges avec ses fils électriques. Il déguste tranquillement ses proies une fois électrocutées."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pone trampas con hilos electrificados. De este modo, electrocuta a sus enemigos y los inmoviliza por completo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They employ an electrically charged web to trap their prey. While it is immobilized by shock, they leisurely consume it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"電気を 帯びた 糸で ワナを 仕掛ける。感電して 動けない 獲物を ゆっくりと いただくのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand on l’attaque, il projette une multitude de fils électrifiés pour créer une barrière électrique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando un enemigo lo ataca, expulsa por la boca hilos electrificados para crear una barrera."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When attacked, they create an electric barrier by spitting out many electrically charged threads."},{"language":"ja",